  "body": "### Summary\n\nAs a user of the Swift and Rétro 5250 themes (#733, PR #1369), I want their full look, so that they match the operator's boards and not only their colours and font.\n\n### Scope\n\nEngine tokens and art not built by LOT-192:\n- Swift: card radius 24, halos, aurora gradient used sparingly, soft shadow in light only (draft `extras` of `docs/assets/themes/tokens/themes.json`).\n- Rétro 5250: square corners, dashed separators, uppercase section headers, blinking cursor (`retro-cursor`, off with Reduce Motion), and the reverse-video selection question: green on black selection fails THEMES.md §3 (1:1), so either the rule or the look gives way (operator decision).\n\nChecks LOT-192 could not do (no logged-in session):\n- Rétro 5250 at Dynamic Type AX5 (monospace wraps, nothing clipped) and `[code]` still distinct from body text in the reader.\n- Screenshots of the forum list and a topic page, light/dark (Swift) and single (Rétro), no real pseudo.\n- Operator confirmation of the draft colours LOT-192 had to change (table in PR #1369).\n\n### Sources\n\n#733, PR #1369, `docs/THEMES.md` §2–§4, `docs/assets/themes/boards/theme-swift.jpg`, `theme-retro.jpg`.\n\n### Acceptance criteria\n\n- [ ] Each item of the scope built or explicitly dropped by the operator.\n- [ ] AX5 and reader `[code]` checks done; screenshots in the PR.\n- [ ] Contrast test still green; Reduce Motion respected.\n\n---\n_Generated by [Claude Code](https://claude.ai/code)_\n",
